   754	`F ⪯ B` when the node accepted B. The FG reads only `TF`. `fBasis` holds the
   755	accepting carrier, the J carrier and the viability witness of the last F
   756	acceptance. -/
   757	structure Store (V : Type) where
   758	  T : Finset (FGBlock V)
   759	  TF : Finset (FGBlock V)
   760	  F : FGBlock V
   761	  J : FGBlock V
   762	  h_j : Height
