   983	  - `frontier_mono`: `Finset.sup_mono`.
   984	  - `lexMax_mono`: `Finset.sup_mono` on the filtered pairs; with `hinj` the key of the picked pair equals the sup. If `Vw` has no candidate, its key is the fallback key `(0, genesisRoot)`, and every candidate key is at least that (`justified_zero_is_genesis`, Task 4).
