   150	`(h_j, J)` exactly when a justification is not yet finalized *and* the record
   151	allows it; otherwise the empty pair, which is `none` of an `Option FinalityPair`.
   152	
   153	**This action does not write the lock.** `record_attestation` does, from the emitted
   154	attestation.
