   767	```text
   768	gap: no top J
   769	    -> uncontested top J
   770	    -> contested top J
   771	
   772	or gap -> contested top J.
   773	```
   774	
   775	The first top-J evidence and the first contest evidence can each
   776	interrupt an attempt once. Within P of each event, accepted-object
   777	relay and a later freeze put the relevant evidence in every view.
   778	Repeated copies do not start a new phase. Later frontier blocks only
   779	add witnesses once the phase is settled.
