  1261	descends the FG root.  Grades~2 and~1 are used positively, through their
  1262	active prefix.  Grade~0 is used only negatively, as a veto: a block is
  1263	\emph{grade-0 compatible} when it is compatible with the saved grade-0
  1264	block, and every block is while that field is~$\bot$.  The veto is
